        Quest("CH1-093",1,93,"Snapper Claws",category="Khorinis - Upper Quarter",giver = "Lutero",location="Khorinis - Upper Quarter",prerequisites="Ask Lutero in Chapter 1; kill the special snapper in the Valley of Mines during Chapter 2.",summary="Recover the claws of a special snapper leader in the Valley of Mines for Lutero.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Ask Lutero in the Upper Quarter to arrange a reward for a powerful snapper's claws.","In Chapter 2, during Hunting Snappers in the Valley of Mines, speak with Bilgot about the snapper pack leader so that it appears near the tower.","Kill the leader and take its claws; no trophy-harvesting skill is necessary.","Return the claws to Lutero for payment and a guild-dependent bonus."),reward="1,000 XP and 400 gold. Warriors: Ring of Invincibility (+25 protection against all damage types); mages: key to a chest containing 5 rune stones, 3 elder rune stones and 1 highest rune stone.",warnings="Asking Bilgot about the pack leader is required to make the creature appear. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/kogti-sneppera.67093/",searchTags=listOf("snapper claws","khorinis - upper quarter","local quest giver in khorinis - upper quarter")),
        Quest("CH1-094",1,94,"Salandril's Research",category="Khorinis - Upper Quarter",giver = "Salandril",location="Khorinis - Upper Quarter",prerequisites="Complete Gallahad's Task; some ingredient hunting may require the Valley of Mines or Orc City.",summary="Supply Salandril with samples of orc drink, then help him brew a potion from the substance.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After completing Gallahad's Task, bring Salandril one sample of the orc drink found on some dead orcs.","Wait several days for Salandril to study the sample.","Gather another ten bottles of the orc drink, from orcs, ogres or Orc City chests, and give them to Salandril.","During the next dialogue, bring an additional ten bottles and 300 gold to obtain Salandril's experimental potion."),reward="Quest stages: 100 XP, 150 XP, 800 XP and 1,000 XP. For an additional 10 orc drinks and 300 gold, receive one Orc Drink potion (-3 Mana, +2 Strength or Dexterity).",warnings="Salandril produces only one potion in this chain. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/issledovanija-salandrila.67238/",searchTags=listOf("salandril's research","khorinis - upper quarter","local quest giver in khorinis - upper quarter")),
